<body>
<center>
<img height=150
     src="http://www.hanumanfellowship.org/files/hanuman.png">
</center>
<p>
Dear $sanskrit,
<p>
We are reaching out to you as a former member of the Hanuman Fellowship
to ask you to consider rejoining the Fellowship for the coming year. We
sincerely value our relationship with you and all members of our
satsang and respectfully invite your continued commitment and
participation as a member of the Hanuman Fellowship.
<p>
The Hanuman Fellowship is a thriving community of spiritual practice
that honors our yogic roots and inspires peaceful transformation in
ourselves and the world. Your continued involvement contributes
to the long term sustainability of our mission, our community, and our
aim of continuing the legacy of the teachings of Baba Hari Dass for 
decades to come. Membership
dues, along with general donations, support a wide variety of needs,
including staff livelihoods, land stewardship, and Hanuman Fellowship
events and programs that foster peace, self-inquiry, and selfless service.
<p>
<b>
If you would like to be included as a voting member and wish to vote for
the HFS Board of Directors at the Annual Meeting, you must renew your
membership by October 16th. Our Annual General Meeting will be held
on Sunday, November 16, 2025.
</b>
<p>
Please submit your payment of \$50. You can pay your membership dues
securely online by <a href='https://akash.mountmadonna.org/cgi-bin/omp?code=$secure_code'>clicking here</a>.
If you wish to pay with a personal
check, please mail your payment to the address listed below
with a note that it is for your "HFS Membership".
In addition to membership dues, we gratefully accept <a href='https://www.mountmadonna.org/donate'>donations</a> of any size.
<p>
Please note:
<ul>
<li>Communications are primarily by email, so please make sure that we have your
current email address and other contact information.
<li>To claim a tax deduction for this donation, first deduct the value
of any benefits you receive.
The Hanuman Fellowship is a 501c (3) tax exempt organization,
IRS Section 170(b)(2)(iii) for both federal and state tax purposes.
FEIN: 51-0174679.
</ul>
We look forward to welcoming you back as a member of the Hanuman Fellowship!
<p>
Peace,<br>
Membership Secretary<br>
445 Summit Road, Watsonville, CA 95076<br>
<a href='mailto:memberships@mountmadonna.org'>memberships@mountmadonna.org</a>
</body>
